{"full":"hmpl-language/hmpl","name":"hmpl","description":"🐜 HMPL.js is a lightweight server-oriented template language for JavaScript. Fetch HTML, render it safely, and keep apps dynamic, modern, and small.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":965,"forks":119,"created":"2024-11-04T22:13:15Z","updated":"2026-08-31T21:57:50Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hmpl-lang.dev","topics":["ajax","fetch","fetch-api","hacktoberfest","hateoas","hmpl","html","hypermedia","javascript","rest","server-side","template-engine","template-language","templating","typescript"],"demo":"https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/hmpl-playground-hz6k9t?file=%2Findex.html%3A13%2C44","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.659Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.659Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.659Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:26.031Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:10.334Z","stars":966,"forks":119},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:32.236Z","stars":966,"forks":119},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.659Z","stars":965,"forks":119}],"technologies":[],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:37.567Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🌐 Website • 📄 Docs • 🖥️ Demo Sandbox • ⚙️ Examples","HMPL.js provides the flexibility to build server-driven templates with minimal JavaScript. With its block-based syntax, customizable fetch requests, and built-in support for forms, events, and time-based syncing you can deliver dynamic user interfaces without relying on a heavy framework. HMPL integrates with JSON5 for expressive object syntax and DOMPurify for safe HTML rendering, all in just a few kilobytes.","Using template language capabilities, you can multiply reduce the size of the application bundle. Full customization of the request based on the modern fetch standard, as well as support for all the functionality necessary for modern work in applications (request indicator, sending by event, automatic generation of body for the form, caching) and the syntax of the object in the markup, which requires a minimum number of characters, will help to build interaction with the server and client as efficiently as possible. App size comparison (bytes):"],"features":["Customizable: Send a custom request to the server when receiving the UI","Memory Preserving: Reduce file sizes on the client by several times","Based on Fetch API: Use a modern standard instead of XMLHTTPRequest","Server-oriented: Work with the server directly through markup and with a little js","Generate thousands of DOM nodes from a single template: Work with large components not only on the server but also on the client"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hmpl-language/hmpl/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6fda04a6d2d42867b8119df947a1a3e8365a0d249f19ce767f1ba977535d0497","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:28:09.073Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:40.101Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-31T21:57:50Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🌐 Website • 📄 Docs • 🖥️ Demo Sandbox • ⚙️ Examples","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hmpl-language/hmpl/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6fda04a6d2d42867b8119df947a1a3e8365a0d249f19ce767f1ba977535d0497","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hmpl-language/hmpl/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:40.102Z"},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:50.143Z","latestRelease":{"name":"3.2.1","tag":"3.2.1","publishedAt":"2025-11-29T12:42:23Z","url":"https://github.com/hmpl-language/hmpl/releases/tag/3.2.1"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:50.143Z","screenshots":[],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/hmpl-playground-hz6k9t?file=%2Findex.html%3A13%2C44","attemptedAt":"2026-10-05T16:22:27.002Z","status":"unknown","error":{"reason":"access_restricted","at":"2026-10-05T16:22:27.002Z"},"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-06T16:22:27.002Z","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":5,"probeVersion":2},"readmeS